er purchases.\nAccept multiple payment methods.\nRestock shelves and organize inventory.\nManage a growing supermarket with increasing customer flow.\nUnlock new products and expand your store.\nSmooth VR interactions designed for immersive gameplay.\nComplete daily tasks and improve store efficiency.\n\nWhether you enjoy management games, cashier simulators, or supermarket experiences, Supermarket Manager: VR Cashier offers an engaging VR simulation where every customer counts.", "short_description": "Run your own VR supermarket! Scan products, manage checkout, serve customers, restock shelves, and grow your store in this immersive cashier and supermarket management simulator."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/javairiabibi/privacy-policy-meta", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zylo Studio VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/javairiabibi/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN", "zh_HK", "zh_TW", "ja", "de", "fr", "it", "ko", "pt", "th", "es", "tr", "ru"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1179507641916728"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2603592840105678"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3212900928897537"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1573613870797136"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1